<title>MOROCCO: Spain grants Morocco $40 mln credit line.</title>
<headline>Spain grants Morocco $40 mln credit line.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain and Morocco signed an accord on Wednesday under which the Spanish Official Credit Institute will grant Rabat credit of six billion pesetas ($40 million) for 25 years at 1.5 percent interest, the Moroccan finance ministry said.</p>
<p>It said the credit line, with a grace period of 10 years, was aimed at promoting small and medium firms.</p>
</text>
